# LV3PartyPrivateMonster (27261, level 76) spawned on its own (no master), whose template hates the human race at 20%
# (SetHateRace @race_human, ratio 20), every draw 0: the character casts Ultimate Debuff (4694, aggro points above 0) on a
# monster beside it. While the private is not swinging, nothing changes; while it swings at that monster, its top desire
# target, it gains the formula aggro / (76 + 7) + 20 / 100 * aggro / (76 + 7), times 150.
character Hunter 20
skill 4694 1
roll player 0
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.WarriorBase
script script.ai.individual.Monster.LV3Monster.LV3Monster
script script.ai.individual.Monster.LV3Monster.LV3PartyPrivateMonster
npc priv 27261 Monster 60 0 0 level 76 walks ai SetHateRace=@race_human,SetHateRaceRatio=20
npc wolf 20120 Monster 60 100 0

want priv wolf 100
  desires priv attack(wolf)=100
cast wolf 4694
  S MagicSkillUse caster=player target=wolf skill=4694-1 hit=0 reuse=0 success=0
  S SystemMessage id=46 4:4694,1
  desires priv attack(wolf)=100
swing priv
cast wolf 4694
  S MagicSkillUse caster=player target=wolf skill=4694-1 hit=0 reuse=0 success=0
  S SystemMessage id=46 4:4694,1
  desires priv attack(player)=216.8674698795181 attack(wolf)=100
